        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en"># Included processes\nSwiss electricity mix, from wind farm. Includes the operation of the wind farm with the necessary change of gear oil.\n100MW wind farm, consisting of 2.3MW onshore turbines (conrete and steel towers) and 3.4MW onshore wind turbines.\nModel is based on the electricity production in Switzerland between 2020-2024, with a capacity factor of 19.7% (source: BFE 2025).\nAssumed lifetime is 25 years. Annual electricity production is 173 GWh, applying a capacity factor of 19.7%.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
